      "mergedPostDetails": "During any kind of VRChat's Photon Degradation or Maintanance. Persistance data never gets properly saved.. Instead it will get rollbacked to some previous state. Which may sometimes roll it back upwards of 12h or so. Which is very annoying for any users playing in any kind of game worlds especially Idle games.\n\nThese things can then cause major set backs for players.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Persistence roll-back during Maintanance",
